phi|n|The act of estimating. ; An opinion or judgment of the worth, extent, or quantity of anything, formed without using precise data; valuation; as, estimations of distance, magnitude, amount, or moral qualities. ; Favorable opinion; esteem; regard; honor. ; Supposition; conjecture.	a:1r3n,85,6~1r3n,85,6	n:22cu,30,7~22cu,30,7
